---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import portrait from '../assets/kapil-side.webp'
---

<section class="intro" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
  <div class="intro-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Hello, I’m Kapil.</p>
    <h1 id="intro-title">Making ambitious work simpler and more human.</h1>
    <p>
      I am a Tech Leader based in Germany, and my mission is to help organisations and people find their own answers and unleash their potential. Observance is where I share my thoughts, learnings, mistakes, and experiments. Essays is where I dive deeper into specific topics and ideas.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="intro-portrait">
    <Image src={portrait} alt="Kapil Dube" width={200} height={200} />
  </div>
</section>
